The '''Kajain'sa'Nikto''', also known as the '''Red Nikto''', were a subspecies of the [[Sentience|sentient]] [[humanoid]] [[Nikto]] [[species]] from the [[planet]] [[Kintan]].<ref name="DB" /> Their natural habitat was [[desert]] or wastelands.<ref name="VE" /> Aside from their skin [[color]], they were also distinguished by their scaly, coarse skin, and their horns and spikes. They also have tubes on their necks. Members of the subspecies included the [[Jedi Master]] [[Ima-Gun Di]],<ref name="DB" /> galactic [[crime lord]] [[Rinnrivin Di]],<ref name="Bloodline">[[Bloodline (novel)|''Bloodline'']]</ref> and [[Vedain]], an employee of [[Jabba Desilijic Tiure|Jabba]] the [[Hutt]],<ref name="DB" /> [[Leoz]],<ref name="The Triple Dark">{{Resistance|The Triple Dark}}</ref> [[Narvin]]<ref name="A Quick Salvage Run">{{Resistance|A Quick Salvage Run}}</ref> and the [[Unidentified Warbird pirate|unidentified pirate]] of the [[Warbird gang]].<ref name="The Triple Dark" /> Many Kajain'sa'Nikto lived to serve the Hutt families as well.<ref name="Eminence">{{TCW|Eminence (episode)}}</ref>

